{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/12620","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"NA737.W7 A31x 1943","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"12620","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"An autobiography. Broadacre City] ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Wright, Frank Lloyd,","id":"actor/wright-frank-lloyd","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Taliesin","id":"actor/taliesin","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1943","begin_of_the_begin":"1943-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1943-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera : originally housed in printer's proof mailing envelope from Taliesin Spring Green Wisconsin to Georgia O'Keefe [sic] ; annotation and small drawing by unknown on verso : -Moltier-.\nEphemera found with publication : Newspaper clipping : Talk with Frank Lloyd Wright by Harvey Breit, New York Times, July 24, 1949.\nEphemera found with publication : Newspaper clipping : Wax Firm Plans Novel Tower for Research Center by unknown author, New York [Herald Tribune], undated.\nEphemera found with publication : Partial booklet, Gallery Notes, from unknown source with article Building a Democracy by Frank Lloyd Wright ; found between pp. 16-17 : [architectural] sketch with handwriting by unknown.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nA Taliesin publication.\nCover title.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : fair condit